                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "昨日は確変が止まらなくて、結局閉店間際まで打ち続けてしまったよ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
